{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225430","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222543001:0":{"text":"후긴, 너무 빨리 가잖아! 대포의 위력을 시험해 보는 것도 좋지만, 너무 서두르지 말라고!","source_cn":"呼……呼金，你跑得太快了！要试火炮的威力也不能这么着急！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAFCAAEFABE19C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222543002:0":{"text":"저건 악마라고. 진짜 악마!","source_cn":"那可是恶魔！货真价实的恶魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A433BC7291FF52E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222543003:0":{"text":"절대적인 기술과 화력 앞에서 숨을 쉬는 모든 것들은 경의를 표해야 해!","source_cn":"在绝对的技术和火力面前，所有能呼吸的东西，都应该展示敬意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x487BF8C01CCC4E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222543004:0":{"text":"목표가 보이는군! 서쪽 고지대에 있어. 저게 너희가 말한 악마인가?","source_cn":"我已经发现目标了，在西侧的高地上，那就是你们说的恶魔吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x461BEFB0B22D2C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:10:1222544001:":{"text":"배고파...!","source_cn":"饿……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x360A007B8438FEF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl